	And I create a product with the following values
	| Name | Liferay Digital Experience Platform | |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         |                |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} |                |
	| Perpetual               | true                     |                |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp1          | propertyValue1 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp2          | propertyValue2 |
	| Product Field and Value | additionalProp3          | propertyValue3 |
	| Quantity                | 1                        |                |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       |                |
	| Status                  | Approved                 |                |
	And I create an external link for a product purchase made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Domain      | liferaydxppurchase |
	| Entity Id   | 12345              |
	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPPurchase |
	Then the external link with the entity id "12345" should be present on the product purchase made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" with the following values
	| Domain      | liferaydxppurchase |
	| Entity Id   | 12345              |
	| Entity Name | LiferayDXPPurchase |
	And the external link with the entity id "12345" on the product purchase made by account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" should not be visible to non permissioned users
	And I should not be able to view a product purchase on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the product "Liferay Digital Experience Platform" using the external link domain "liferaydxppurchase" and entity name "LiferayDXPPurchase" and entity id "12345" as a non permissioned user

